{"author":{"id":"86dc3c885e4fa466d19699d4a5e74c240f1c9d6b23f4e62ea2d2d8e359bd1711"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790790118,"nonce":"hNJmkY/Kws76ZgrerAC0JE0tWFs=","title":"Deploy beta.2 download link on the live site","message":"\u003c!-- ABOUTME: Records beta.2 release publication and the remaining live-site deployment step. --\u003e\n\u003c!-- ABOUTME: Separates verified installer assets and committed site links from production deployment acceptance. --\u003e\n\n## Request\n\nFabian requested a beta.2 build directly from main, without branches or PRs, and a site download link update.\n\n## Completed\n\n- Coordinated version preparation was pushed directly to main at `173dda90621371b253accf225df671a1df9c7480`; GPT-6 Luna performed preparation and full quality gates, and GPT-6.1 Sol approved it.\n- Main-only signed/notarized installer workflow succeeded: https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/actions/runs/36749251355 .\n- Official downloaded DMG checksum, integrity, signatures, stapled notarization ticket, Gatekeeper acceptance, Apple Silicon architecture, and numeric versions `0.9.0` / `0.9.1` were independently verified. No app GUI launch was performed.\n- GitHub prerelease https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/releases/tag/v0.9.0-beta.2 and its tag target the verified source commit. Public DMG SHA-256 is `7ce03a706f451e4684eedc9d163190ccbda6138aa88d38ad18860b9a6278254e`, matching the checksum asset and GitHub digest.\n- Site release URL and label now point to beta.2 in main commit `67692f2359a3b8589cd71e7cddf5808027217514`. Site typecheck/build and root lint/format/diff checks passed. The existing gray-matter direct-eval build advisory is separately tracked by `2301c6d`, not changed as part of this release.\n\n## Remaining acceptance\n\nThe production https://giclang.cc/downloads/ page still serves beta.1. Its Coolify application needs deployment from current main. No configured Coolify CLI, MCP tool, or profile deployment credentials were available; operator deployment input was requested rather than claiming production success.\n\n- Redeploy the existing site application using its dedicated `Dockerfile.site` from main.\n- Verify the live Downloads page displays beta.2 and its release link reaches the published prerelease containing the DMG and checksum.\n- Keep experimental sketch feature issues #85–87 open for their separate native GUI acceptance and concrete bugs.","files":null}]}